<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">biome</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">biome</ansi> tells you a little bit about the biome you are located in.

Different biomes have risks or benefits associated with them.

Some places are open to the sky, some are shaded by trees, and some
are roofed or underground. See <ansi fg="command">help light</ansi>.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

::keep
  <ansi fg="command">biome</ansi>
::
